==Battleground==
*1 [[Rain D.]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Rain D.]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Rain D.]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s (100%) spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 16.67~33.33 seconds<sup>500f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s (200%) spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Duche]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 40~60 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Duche]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Gabriel]]s (100%) spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**3 [[Doge Dark]]s (200%) spawn, delay 8.33~16.67 seconds<sup>250f~500f</sup>.
**3 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 33.33~50 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,500f</sup>.
**3 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 40~60 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,800f</sup>.
**5 [[Christmas D.|Christmas Ds]] spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

